An Authorised Person or Recognised Body carrying on Islamic Financial Business must ensure that the financial statements required to be produced by it under GEN 6 contain the following additional disclosures:
(a)	the role and authority of the Shari'a Supervisory Board in overseeing the Authorised Person's or Recognised Body’s Islamic Financial Business;
(b)	the method used in the calculation of the Zakat base;
(c)	whether Zakat has been paid by the Authorised Person or Recognised Body;
